Hello, at the start of each month I would like to check our budget, please.

First, please ask me for our income for the month. Then please ask me for each of our regular bills, one at a time: rent, utilities, insurance and phone.

Please add up the bills, take them away from the income, and show me what is left.

If what is left is less than $500, please give us a warning so we know to be careful.

After that, please ask me how much we want to save each month, and tell me how many months it will take us to reach a $5,000 emergency fund.

Thank you!
